 arrays of order I\u00d72\u00d72 or I\u00d73\u00d73","volume":"388","author":"Ten Berge","year":"2004","journal-title":"Linear Algebra Appl."},{"key":"10.1016\/j.laa.2010.06.027_bib38","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"534","DOI":"10.1137\/S0895479899352045","article-title":"Rank-one approximation to high order tensors","volume":"23","author":"Zhang","year":"2001","journal-title":"SIAM J. Matrix Anal. Appl."}],"container-title":["Linear Algebra and its Applications"],"language":"en","link":[{"URL":"https:\/\/api.elsevier.com\/content\/article\/PII:S002437951000323X?httpAccept=text\/xml","content-type":"text\/xml","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"text-mining"},{"URL":"https:\/\/api.elsevier.com\/content\/article\/PII:S002437951000323X?httpAccept=text\/plain","content-type":"text\/plain","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"text-mining"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2019,5,31]],"date-time":"2019-05-31T09:29:40Z","timestamp":1559294980000},"score":32.987934,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/linkinghub.elsevier.com\/retrieve\/pii\/S002437951000323X"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2010,12]]},"references-count":38,"journal-issue":{"issue":"7","published-print":{"date-parts":[[2010,12]]}},"alternative-id":["S002437951000323X"],"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1016\/j.laa.2010.06.027","ISSN":["0024-3795"],"issn-type":[{"value":"0024-3795","type":"print"}],"published":{"date-parts":[[2010,12]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,11,12]],"date-time":"2026-11-12T04:49:58Z","timestamp":1794458998151,"version":"4.9.1"},"edition-number":"0","reference-count":1,"publisher":"CRC Press","isbn-type":[{"value":"9780429227646","type":"electronic"}],"content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2013,10,1]]},"DOI":"10.1201\/b15810-57","type":"book-chapter","created":{"date-parts":[[2013,10,22]],"date-time":"2013-10-22T11:29:32Z","timestamp":1382441372000},"page":"319-324","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Pattern recognition framework based on the best rank-(R1, R2, \u2026, RK) tensor approximation"],"prefix":"10.1201","member":"301","reference":[{"key":"ref50","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Chen, J. Saad, Y. 2009. On the Tensor SVD and the Optimal Low Rank Orthogonal Approximation of Tensors. SIAM Journal on Matrix Analysis and Applications 30(4): 1709\u20131734.","DOI":"10.1137\/070711621"}],"container-title":["Computational Vision and Medical Image Processing IV"],"language":"en","deposited":{"date-parts":[[2021,4,10]],"date-time":"2021-04-10T04:36:40Z","timestamp":1618029400000},"score":32.562344,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/www.taylorfrancis.com\/books\/9781315812922\/chapters\/10.1201\/b15810-57"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2013,10,1]]},"ISBN":["9780429227646"],"references-count":1,"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1201\/b15810-57","relation":{"is-part-of":[{"id-type":"doi","id":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1201\/b15810","asserted-by":"object"}]},"published":{"date-parts":[[2013,10,1]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,9,26]],"date-time":"2026-09-26T14:24:11Z","timestamp":1790432651746,"version":"4.1.0"},"reference-count":36,"publisher":"Society for Industrial & Applied Mathematics (SIAM)","issue":"3","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["SIAM J. Matrix Anal. Appl."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2012,1]]},"abstract":"<jats:p>In this paper, we show that for a symmetric tensor, its best symmetric rank-$1$ approximation is its best rank-$1$ approximation. Based on this result, a positive lower bound for the best rank-$1$ approximation ratio of a symmetric tensor is given. Furthermore, a higher order polynomial spherical optimization problem can be reformulated as a multilinear spherical optimization problem. Then, we present a modified power algorithm for solving the homogeneous polynomial spherical optimization problem. Numerical results are presented, illustrating the effectiveness of the proposed algorithm.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1137\/110835335","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2012,7,26]],"date-time":"2012-07-26T11:51:21Z","timestamp":1343303481000},"page":"806-821","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":71,"title":["The Best Rank-1 Approximation of a Symmetric Tensor and Related Spherical Optimization Problems"],"prefix":"10.1137","volume":"33","author":[{"given":"Xinzhen","family":"Zhang","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Chen","family":"Ling","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Liqun","family":"Qi","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"351","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2012,7,26]]},"reference":[{"key":"atypb1","first-page":"2","author":"Comon P.","year":"1998","journal-title":"San Diego"},{"key":"atypb2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1137\/060661569"},{"key":"atypb3","unstructured":"A. Ghosh, E. Tsigaridas, M. Descoteaux, P. Comon, B. Mourrain, and R. Deriche,\n                      A polynomial based approach to extract the maxima of an antipodally symmetric spherical function and its application to extract fiber directions from the orientation distribution function in diffusion MRI\n                      , Computational Diffusion MRI Workshop, New York, 2008."},{"key":"atypb4","unstructured":"O. Grellier and P. Comon,\n                      Analytical blind discrete source separation\n                      , in Proceedings of the the European Signal Processing Conference, Tampere, Finland, 2000."},{"key":"atypb5","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s10107-010-0409-z"},{"key":"atypb6","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1137\/S0895479801387413"},{"key":"atypb7","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1137\/100801482"},{"key":"atypb8","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"S. Lang,