ain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["SIAM J. Matrix Anal. Appl."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2020,1]]},"abstract":"<jats:p>We establish a new extremal property of the classical Chebyshev polynomials in the context of best rank-one approximation of tensors. We also give some necessary conditions for a tensor to be a minimizer of the ratio of spectral and Frobenius norms.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1137\/19m1269713","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2020,3,3]],"date-time":"2020-03-03T11:50:14Z","timestamp":1583236214000},"page":"308-331","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":8,"title":["Chebyshev Polynomials and Best Rank-one Approximation Ratio"],"prefix":"10.1137","volume":"41","author":[{"given":"Andrei","family":"Agrachev","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Khazhgali","family":"Kozhasov","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Andr\u00e9","family":"Uschmajew","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"351","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2020,3,3]]},"reference":[{"key":"atypb1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.4064\/sm-7-1-36-44"},{"key":"atypb2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/0022-314X(90)90075-3"},{"key":"atypb3","first-page":"539","volume":"7","author":"Chebyshev P. L.","year":"1854","journal-title":"M\u00e9m. Acad. Sci. P\u00e9tersb."},{"key":"atypb4","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1090\/S0002-9947-1975-0367131-6"},{"key":"atypb5","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"F. H. Clarke,\n                      Optimization and Nonsmooth Analysis\n                      , Classics in Appl. Math. 5, SIAM, Philadelphia, PA, 1990.","DOI":"10.1137\/1.9781611971309"},{"key":"atypb6","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1215\/S0012-7094-92-06505-7"},{"key":"atypb7","doi-asserted-by":"p